WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.920
What's the movie?
Would this be cheating in Leon's favor?

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:04.880
Cheating for Leon.
Do you know it, Leon?

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.640
I'm guessing. It's wrong, but I,
I have to come up with a theory.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.140
That's how my mind works.
I'm sure it's not right.

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:12.440
Oh, okay. What's that?

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:14.920
Super easy. Super easy? Yep.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.560
There are some chariots.
If there are chariots, it can't be Greek.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.600
My lips are, my lips are sealed.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:22.480
Ready? Go.
I don't know what it is.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:25.720
These people aren't Greek.
This isn't the fall of Troy.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.620
That's a Roman legion.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:32.040
Isn't it? I can't... A Roman
legion with spears, Nilce?

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.200
It's not a Roman legion.
A Roman legion with th...

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.019
It's an urban legion.
It's not Troy, is it?

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:38.640
Is it Troy, Leon?

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.160
I don't know. Those little
boats do look like Troy, right?

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.680
Every Greek ship ever
shown in a movie is wrong.

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:45.479
I'm going with what I put second, okay?

00:00:45.519 --> 00:00:48.280
Ready? Go. Okay, I stuck
with what I put second.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:53.000
Got it. Got it, phew.
Phew! Woo-hoo!

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:54.699
Achilles!

00:00:56.080 --> 00:01:00.819
Troy! And that's not
what the ships were like.
